1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,170
You sleep, wake up early, work, work,

2
00:00:03,170 --> 00:00:05,890
work, go home, routine, rush,

3
00:00:05,890 --> 00:00:08,530
go to bed, try to fit everything into one day,

4
00:00:08,530 --> 00:00:09,890
the rat race.

5
00:00:09,890 --> 00:00:11,090
And the problem is:

6
00:00:11,090 --> 00:00:13,970
sometimes it's fine to do this for a few years,

7
00:00:13,970 --> 00:00:16,530
for some goals, for some stability,

8
00:00:16,530 --> 00:00:19,842
of course, always trying to mix in a little joy,

9
00:00:19,842 --> 00:00:21,122
which is the currency of life,

10
00:00:21,122 --> 00:00:22,242
a little comfort.

11
00:00:22,242 --> 00:00:23,202
But until when?

12
00:00:23,202 --> 00:00:26,320
Until when will you think life is only this?
